            "review_title": "Review at Mr Beer",
            "review_text": "Pat F\nSan Diego, California19 contributions\n0\nFresh, authentic northern cuisine served streetside just across from Hanoi's West Lake, an urban treasure. Try BBQ pork, dry por\nSep 2024 • Friends\nAlso have Bun Oc, snail rice noodle soup.\n\nSpecial Beer -- in shiny, icy silver containers -- from an independent local producer seems to go well with everything. Pirate Beer, a darker craft product, has its followers.\nWritten September 28, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
