            "review_title": "Review at Mr Beer",
            "review_text": "Ichdien000\nCardiff, United Kingdom485 contributions\n0\nExpensive European Type Bar\nMar 2020\nHad a few drinks at this rather expensive European type bar- It's a quality establishment with good service and all is well done but for me it just lacked a bit of atmosphere that you'd expect to find in Ho Chi Minh City. Guess it's aimed at an expat type resident in the city - just didn't connect to me sadly.\nValue\nService\nWritten March 30, 2020",
